SUMMARY:Camp Parsons Summer Camp 2027 – Session 1
LOCATION:Camp Parsons\, Brinnon\, Washington
DESCRIPTION:Chief Seattle Council\nhttps://global.scoutingevent.com/609-Ca
 mpParsons2027\n\nArchery\, Canoeing\n\nCamp Parsons is situated on the Ol
 ympic Peninsula “where the mountains meet the sea”. This beautiful se
 tting offers the rare experience of canoeing on glassy salt water while v
 iewing densely forested shoreline. Operating since 1919\, this venerable 
 Scout camp features swimming\, canoeing and sailing\, climbing tower\, ri
 fle and archery ranges\, climbing tower and other popular activities.\nCa
 mpsite Matrix\nCopper City A\n(capacity: 1 unit\, 20 attendees)\nSession 
 1\nSession 2\nSession 3\nSession 4\nSession 5\n
URL:https://global.scoutingevent.com/609-CampParsons2027
END:VEVENT
